{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/14japg32","slide":2,"text":"CURRENT CHALLENGE","textPreview":"CURRENT CHALLENGE","textChars":17,"textLines":1,"bbox":[78,145,240,20]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/03atgbmh","slide":2,"text":"Small stores often rely on handwritten records and memory during busy selling hours.","textPreview":"Small stores often rely on handwritten records and memory during busy selling hours.","textChars":84,"textLines":1,"bbox":[78,176,520,112]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/f21sn6lw","slide":2,"text":"01","textPreview":"01","textChars":2,"textLines":1,"bbox":[78,336,60,34]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/e1sbe14r","slide":2,"text":"Manual sales and stock records take time and can contain errors.","textPreview":"Manual sales and stock records take time and can contain errors.","textChars":64,"textLines":1,"bbox":[152,330,430,72]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/t0zalw36","slide":2,"text":"02","textPreview":"02","textChars":2,"textLines":1,"bbox":[78,432,60,34]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/szq9cbml","slide":2,"text":"Internet-dependent systems can stop the checkout process when the connection fails.","textPreview":"Internet-dependent systems can stop the checkout process when the connection fails.","textChars":83,"textLines":1,"bbox":[152,426,430,78]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/y5wfqpkf","slide":2,"bbox":[660,150,492,440]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/z65gzul0","slide":2,"text":"PROPOSED SOLUTION","textPreview":"PROPOSED SOLUTION","textChars":17,"textLines":1,"bbox":[710,202,340,22]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/07exsz2l","slide":2,"text":"A mobile-friendly POS that keeps the store operating offline","textPreview":"A mobile-friendly POS that keeps the store operating offline","textChars":60,"textLines":1,"bbox":[710,244,380,150]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/l8ny1436","slide":2,"text":"Sales save on the device first. The system updates cloud data and backups when internet access returns.","textPreview":"Sales save on the device first. The system updates cloud data and backups when internet access returns.","textChars":103,"textLines":1,"bbox":[710,430,370,102]}
